    "identifier": "hoshigaki-abyssal-bulwark",
    "description": "<p>11th Level Clan Feature</p>\n<p>You are clad in flesh hardened by the pressures of the deep and perseverance. You gain resistance to Chakra and Cold Damage. Also, when you are hit with a Critical Hit, you gain a Will of Fire.</p>\n<p>Additionally, while in your Apex Predator state, you gain immunity to Cold Damage, and you have advantage on saving throws made to resist the Bleed, Dazed and Stunned conditions.</p>",
